## Bonding — product rules

### Share modes

| `shareMode` | When | Reminder |
|-------------|------|----------|
| `together_now` | Parent and child **together** | None — tap WhatsApp (`wa.me`) |
| `remind_later` | **Not together** | **Email to parent only** at `remindAt` |

- **Do not** encourage sending the child link remotely when apart.
- Reminder email nudges the **parent**; CTA → `/bonding/share?inviteId=…` (WhatsApp when together).
- **No push/FCM/SMS** for bonding reminders unless the user explicitly requests it.

### WhatsApp

- **No** WhatsApp Business API — only `https://wa.me/?text=…`
- Templates: `src/constants/whatsapp.ts` ↔ `functions/src/bonding/whatsapp.ts` (keep in sync)

### Backend (`feat/v03-bonding`)

- Callables: `recordBondingInvite`, `markBondingWhatsAppShared`, `markBondingChildLinkOpened`
- Scheduler: `scheduledBondingShareReminders` (every 30 min, `Asia/Jerusalem`)
- Collection: `bonding_invites` — index `status` + `shareReminderAt`
- Docs: `docs/BACKEND-BONDING.md`

```ts
// remind later
recordBondingInvite({ shareMode: 'remind_later', remindAt: '<ISO future>' });
```

